1://! MCP tool exposing the full sealed-blob plugin catalog as one payload.
2://!
3://! Per-plugin tools (`read_plugin_schema_shm(id)`) only ever show a model one
4://! blob at a time, so it can never reason about relationships *across*
5://! plugins. This tool dumps every active plugin's schema in a single
6://! response so the calling model can find cross-blob connections itself —
7://! e.g. for UI generation that combines fields/state from unrelated plugins
8://! in ways a fixed per-plugin template never would.
